{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一段大号白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高，位置靠近屏幕上缘，首先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"隐约抓到他在一段亲近关系中，想得到一句不会改变的承诺，但知道没人能保证永远；具体处境不够明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"隐约感到不安、害怕失去，带有患得患失的意味，但第一眼不能完全确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他担心对方将来不再需要自己，因此想把喜欢藏回去，避免以后受伤；但他其实是真心想对对方好，收回感情反而更难受。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"三段大号白字都很醒目，争夺主视线，缺少明确的主次层级。\",\n    \"每段长句都包含多个意思和转折，需要读完整句才能明确处境与感受。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在三段文字里，需要拼接才能理解人物的处境、担忧以及内心矛盾。\",\n    \"第一段下方的辅助短语连续横向排列，需要在多条信息之间挑选线索。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1fc0f693-824c-4f33-bd14-0d7c065f4f84", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T030848685829Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:09:07.203346+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9aa21aab18db36eedd8b0eb136510e79fab024a58b7f8a5447610f965049da2b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee